    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Scavenger%27s_Guide_to_Droids\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Scavenger's Guide to Droids\">Star Wars Saga Edition Scavenger's Guide to Droids</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>Your systems are insulated to improve your resistance to <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Ion\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ion\">Ion</a> damage.</p><p><b>Prerequisites:</b> (<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Droid\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Droid\">Droid</a> and <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a> 13) or (<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Cyborg_Hybrid\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Cyborg Hybrid\">Cyborg Hybrid</a> and <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">Constitution</a> 13)</p><p><b>Effect:</b> If the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Ion\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ion\">Ion</a> damage (Before being halved) equals or exceeds your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Damage_Threshold\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Damage Threshold\">Damage Threshold</a>, you move only -1 step on the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Condition_Track\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Condition Track\">Condition Track</a>.</p><p><b>Normal:</b> If the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Ion\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ion\">Ion</a> damage (Before being halved) equals or exceeds your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Damage_Threshold\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Damage Threshold\">Damage Threshold</a>, you normally move -2 steps on the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Condition_Track\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Condition Track\">Condition Track</a>.</p>",
